#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:125
msgid ""
"If set to CBR the MP3 encoding is done with a constant bitrate. If set to VBR "
"then a variable bitrate is used. Typically a variable bitrate gets better "
"quality but is often out of sync. You should try it first with some test "
"encodings."
msgstr ""
"Ako je podešeno na CBR MP3 enkodiranje se radi preko konstatne bitrate. Ako je "
"podešeno na VBR onda promjnjiva bitrate je korištena. Tipično promjenjiva "
"bitrate dobiva bolji kvalitet ali je obično izvan sync. Trebali bi ste je "
"probati prvo sa nekim testnim enkodiranjem."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:208
msgid "%1 kbits"
msgstr "%1 kbita"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:287
msgid ""
"Select the video codec to encode to the final movie. XviD (www.xvid.org) is an "
"Open Source codec and has similar features to DivX5. DivX4 is the predecessor "
"to DivX5. All three codecs support 1-pass and 2-pass encoding. XviD (CVS) is "
"support for the latest nightly snapshots of XviD. Regarding quality, try all "
"the different codecs to find out which you prefer. Secondly, read the various "
"forums about MPEG-4 Encoding (www.doom9.org, www.xvid.org, www.divx.net, ... ). "
"The difference between a DivX4 and XviD 2-pass encoded movie is quite small. "
"Sometimes DivX4 (smoother) is better and other times XviD (sharper). If the "
"encoding process crashes then you probably haven't used the codec you have "
"installed. Due to the codec libraries having the same name, you can only use "
"DivX4 or DivX5 and XviD or XviD (CVS). This will be fixed in a future version, "
"so the codecs will auto-detect and can be used with different install "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"Izaberi video kodek da bi enkodiro finalni film. XviD (www.xvid.org) je Open "
"Source projekat i imas slične karakteristike kao DivX5. DivX4 je predcesor "
"DivX5. Sve tri podrške za podršku kodeka 1-pass i 2-pass enkodiranje. XviD "
"(CVS) je podržano od zadnjeg hitca XviD. Pogledom kvalitete, probaj sve razne "
"kodeke da bi saznao koji je vaš lični izbor. Sekundarno, procitajte razne "
"forume o MPEG4 enkodiranju (www.doom9.org, www.xvid.org, www.divx.net, ... ). "
"Razlika izmedju DivX4 i XviF 2-pass enkodiranja filma je poprilično mala. "
"Ponekad DivX (glađi) je bolji a drugi put Xvid (oštriji). Ako se proces "
"enkodiranja sruši onda vjerovatno niste koristili kodek koji ste instalirali. "
"Povodom kodek biblioteka kojie imaju iste nazive, možete samo koristiti DivX4 "
"ili DivX5 i XviD ili XviD (CVS). Ovo će biti ispravljeno u budućim verzijama, "
"tako da će kodeci biti auto-otkriveni i mogu biti korišteno sa različitim "
"lokacijama instaliranja."

