#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:39
msgid "Wrong setting"
msgstr "Pogrešno podešavanje"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:40
msgid ""
"The deinterlace filter YUVDeinterlaceMMX doesn't work with RGB mode. You must "
"enable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""
"Filter ispreplitanja YUVDeintralaceMMX ne radi sa RGB modom. Morate uključiti "
"korištenje YUV bojane širine."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:42
msgid ""
"The deinterlace filter SmartDeinterlace doesn't work with YUV colorspace. It "
"only works with RGB. You must disable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""
"Filter ispreplitanja SmartDeinterlace ne radi sa YUV bojni razmakom. Samo radi "
"sa RGB. Vi morate isključiti korištenje YUV bojane širine."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:52
msgid "Extended Audio/Video Settings"
msgstr "Produžena Audio/Video podešavanja"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:58
msgid "Keyframes:"
msgstr "Ključni okviri:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Keyframes (same as I-frames) are \"full\" pictures of an MPEG-stream. They are "
"similar to a simple JPEG and have the best quality in a video. All pictures "
"following are only stored as differences to a keyframe. Here you can set the "
"maximum distance between two keyframes. In most cases this will rarely be used, "
"as the codec will automatically insert a keyframe on each scene change. Default "
"is 300."
msgstr ""
"Ključni okviri (isiti kao I-okviri) su \"full\" slike MPEG toka. Slični su "
"jednostavnim JPEG i imaju istu kvalitetu u videu. Sve slike koje slijede su "
"samo snimljene kao ralike u ključnim okvirima. Ovdje možete postaviti maximalnu "
"distancu između dva okvira. U većini slučajeva ovo će biti rijetko korišteno, "
"kao što će kodec automatski ubaciti okvire na pojedinu promjenu scene. Standard "
"je 300."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:66
msgid "Crispness:"
msgstr "Hrskavost:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:67
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can smooth the video during the encoding process. It is better to "
"leave crispness at 100% for encoding and smooth the video during playback "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izgladiti video tokom procesa enkodiranja. Bolje je ostaviti "
"hrskavost na 100% za enkodiranje i radije izgladiti video tokom playbeka."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:72
msgid "Audio language:"
msgstr "Audio jezik:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Select the language and the surround mode. Typically there are \"MPEG2 "
"Stereo\", \"AC3 2ch and 6ch\" and \"DTS 6ch\". You can probably choose AC3 6ch, "
"AC3 2ch and MPEG2 Stereo in descending order, depending on your language (It "
"doesn't matter if DTS works or not, you can still try it)."
msgstr ""
"Izaberi jezik i mod okruženja. Tipilno tu su \"MPEG2 Stereo\", \"AC3 2ch i "
"6ch\" i \"DTS 6ch\". Vjervoatno možete izabrati AC3 6ch, AC3 2ch i MPEG2 Stereo "
"u silaznom redu, ovisno o vašem jeziku (nije vazno jel DTS radi ili ne, i dalje "
"ga možete probati)."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:79
msgid "Deinterlace mode:"
msgstr "Ispreplitajući mod:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Select a deinterlace mode if you have interlaced material."
"<ul>"
"<li><strong>Fast</strong> is the standard deinterlace mode</li>"
"<li><strong>Encoder Based</strong> uses the internal deinterlace of the codec "
"(be aware that some codecs may have no deinterlacer)</li>"
"<li><strong>Zoom to Full Frame</strong> no matter how it works but it is rather "
"good and slow. Use this if <strong>Fast</strong> still produces interlace "
"stripes or color artifacts (red shadow, etc.)"
"<li>"
"<li><strong>Drop Field/Half Height</strong> uses only one field and scales "
"it.</li>"
"<li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> provides a smart, motion-based "
"deinterlacing capability. Ported from VirtualDub by Tilmann Bitterberg. "
"Operates in RGB space only. Tilmann did some testing of deinterlace filters "
"available in transcode. You can view and read the result on tibit.org/video/. "
"</li>"
"<li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is a deinterlace for YUV mode by Thomas "
"Oestreich.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Izaberi inspretplitajući mod ako imate ispetljan materijal. "
"<ul>"
"<li><strong>Brzo</strong> is je standardni mod za instreplitanje.</li>"
"<li><strong>Enkoder Temeljen</strong> koristi interni isprepliten kodek (budite "
"upozonerni da neki kodeci nemaju mod za inpreplitajući mod)</li>"
"<li><strong>Zumiraj na Puni Okvir</strong> nevažno kako radi bilo dobro i "
"sporo. Koristi ovo ako <strong>Brzo</strong> i dalje pravi isprepletene take "
"ili mrlja boje (crvene sjenke, itd.)"
"<li>"
"<li><strong>Padajuće polje/Pola Visine</strong> koristi samo jedno polje i "
"promjeni veličinu.</li>"
"<li><strong>Pametni inspreplitajući mod</strong> nudi pametno, pokret-bayirano "
"ispreplitanu mogućnost. Portano od VirtualDub od strane Tilmann Bitterberg. "
"Radi samo u RGB. Tilmann je uradio neke testove ispreplitajućih filtera "
"dostupnih u prenosnom kodu. Vi možete vidjeti i pročitati rezultate na "
"tibit.org/video/. </li>"
"<li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> he ispreplitaju mod za YUV mod od strane "
"Thomas Oeastreich.</li></ul>"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:111
msgid "Resample to 44.1 kHz"
msgstr "Prebaci na 44.1 kHz"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the audio track will be downsampled from 48 kHz to 44.1 "
"kHz. Useful because some soundcards have problems with a sampling rate of 48 "
"kHz."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo izabrano, audio traka će biti smanjena sa 48 kHz na 44.1 kHz. "
"Korisno zato što neke zvučne kartice imaju problema sa svrstavajućom normom od "
"48 kHz."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:115
msgid "Use YUV colorspace."
msgstr "Koristi YUV"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the internal codec works with the YUV colorspace instead of "
"using RGB. Useful because DVD also has YUV colorspace and it is twice fast as "
"RGB. You only need RGB colorspace if a filter needs it (filters not yet "
"supported)."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo čekirano, interni kodeci rade sa YUV umjesto RGB. Korisno iz rayloga "
"jer DVD takođe ima YUV bojani prostor i dva puta je brzi nego kao RGB. Vi samo "
"morate RGB bojano mjeste ako ga filter treba (filtri jos nisu podržani)"

